#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_new.json
msgid ""
"\"Gentlemen, clinical immortality is within our grasp\". There, if I write it"
" here I won't be tempted to put it in the powerpoint"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_psi"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_new.json
msgid "They've done it.  Frikkin laser beams"
